       "text": "Every few minutes"
      },
      {
       "at_word": "four",
       "kind": "title",
       "text": "4 hours per half, per day"
      }
     ]
    },
    "phu_de": "They drift near the surface, | resting motionless | or swimming slowly, | and rise every few minutes | for a calm, easy breath. | Over a full day, | each half of the brain | gets about four hours of sleep."
   },
   "voice": {
    "t0": 49.988,
    "dur": 12.0,
    "file": "build/audio/resting.wav"
   },
   "text": "They drift near the surface, resting motionless or swimming slowly, and rise every few minutes for a calm, easy breath. Over a full day, each half of the brain gets about four hours of sleep.",
